add('icho-candy-toronto-2025','Icho Candy Live in Toronto','2025-11-07','Toronto, Ontario','Jamaican Canadian Association','995 Arrow Road, Toronto, Ontario',15,'Icho Candy|Errol Dunkley|Original Thriller|Donna Makeda|Iley Dread|Mel C|Kalico','Presented by Thriller Music alongside Kings of Kings International, this Toronto listing featured Icho Candy and guests, with Kings of Kings Sounds and Routzman Sounds.')
