add('30th-anniversary-2025','One More Year Pan Dem — 30th Anniversary','2025-05-30','Toronto, Ontario','Jamaican Canadian Center','995 Arrow Road, Toronto, Ontario',0,'Iley Dread|Etana|Professor Nuts|Tony Anthony','The 30th anniversary Jubilee Celebration featured a dinner and show, with Iley Dread, Etana, Professor Nuts and Tony Anthony named on the original poster.')
add('nostalgia-eban-brown-2025','Nostalgia — Eban Brown','2025-02-14','Toronto, Ontario','J.C.C.','995 Arrow Road, North York, Ontario',74,'Eban Brown|Steele|Jimmy Reid|Uncle Jonny|Belinda Brady|Iley Dread','The Valentine’s Night poster features Eban Brown, described on the artwork as a former lead voice of The Stylistics, alongside guest artists and the Hardcore Band. Captured from the live site’s gallery.','https://kingsofkingsinternational.com/gallery/')
